items.doc:
Hit points, flat armor, resistances, and invulnerability frames.

Damage = `amount * (1 - resistance) - max(armor - pierce, 0)`, never
below zero. After a hit that deals damage, the health ignores hits for
`iframes` seconds.

```
use warp_sdk::challenge::{DamageKind, Health, Hit, Resists};
let mut h = Health::new(50.0).armor(2.0)
.resists(Resists::none().strong(DamageKind::Impact));
let out = h.apply(&Hit::new(DamageKind::Impact, 10.0));
assert!(out.dealt < 10.0 && !out.killed);
```

