items.doc:
A list of live projectiles with lifetimes.

```
use warp_sdk::challenge::{DamageKind, Hit, Projectiles, Team};
use warp_sdk::ultraviolet::Vec2;
let mut p = Projectiles::default();
p.spawn(Team::Player, Vec2::zero(), Vec2::new(10.0, 0.0), 0.1, 1.0, Hit::new(DamageKind::Impact, 5.0), 0);
// The closure is the collision test: return the id of what it touches.
let hits = p.step(0.2, |pr| (pr.pos.x > 1.5).then_some(7));
assert_eq!(hits[0].target, 7);
assert!(p.list.is_empty()); // spent on the hit
```

Difficulty numbers at one moment. The director makes them from progress
and the wave number. The arena applies them at spawn.

```
use warp_sdk::challenge::Difficulty;
let early = Difficulty::at(0.0, 1);
let late = Difficulty::at(1.0, 10);
assert!(late.hp > early.hp && late.telegraph < early.telegraph);
```

