The icon for the title bar and the task bar, as a `winit` icon.

Give it to `WindowBuilder::with_window_icon` or to
`Window::set_window_icon`. On Windows, also give a 256 px icon from
[`window_icon_px`] to `WindowBuilderExtWindows::with_taskbar_icon` for a
sharp task bar.

```no_run
use warp_sdk::icon::{window_icon, IconSpec};
