Use this icon for every window that `warp_sdk::run` opens.

Call it once, before `run`. Without it, the engine draws a default icon
from the window title (`warp_core::default_window_icon`), so no window is
without an icon. This icon is the same drawing as the `.ico` file from
[`write_set`], so the window, the files and the `.exe` file agree.

```no_run
use warp_sdk::icon::{self, IconSpec};
# struct Game;
icon::set_window_icon(&IconSpec::from_name("Reef", 0));
// warp_sdk::run::<Game>(warp_sdk::Config { window_title: "Reef", ..Default::default() });
```

