What a [`Source`] does to the grid.

```
use warp_sdk::world::reveal::SourceKind;
assert_ne!(SourceKind::Light, SourceKind::Sonar);
```

items.body:
/// Sets `visible` and `explored`. A lamp, a headlight, the sun.
Light,
/// Sets `explored` only. The player learns the shape, not the present.
Sonar,

items.doc:
A thing that reveals cells: a light or a sonar ping.

```
use warp_sdk::world::reveal::Source;
use warp_sdk::ultraviolet::Vec2;
let lamp = Source::light(Vec2::new(5.0, 5.0), 10.0).feather(3.0).skin(0.5);
let ping = Source::sonar(Vec2::new(5.0, 5.0), 40.0);
```

items.body:
pub eye: Vec2,
pub kind: SourceKind,
/// The reach, in world units.
