A world rectangle that the view stays inside, for example the level.
If the view is larger than the bounds on one axis, the view centres
on the bounds on that axis.

```
use warp_sdk::camera::{Bounds, Camera2d};
use warp_sdk::ultraviolet::Vec2;
let mut cam = Camera2d::new([1280, 720]);
cam.bounds = Some(Bounds::new(Vec2::new(-20.0, -5.0), Vec2::new(20.0, 5.0)));
```

