```
# use warp_sdk::camera::Camera2d;
let c = Camera2d::new([1280, 720]).lit2d(0.0);
assert_eq!(c.size, [1280, 720]);
```

A game-defined resource id. The game picks the numbers.

```
use warp_sdk::economy::ResourceId;
const FOOD: ResourceId = ResourceId(0);
```

What a resource is for. The HUD can use the role to pick a color or a
group, and the game can use it to find "all food".

```
use warp_sdk::economy::Role;
assert_ne!(Role::Food, Role::Fuel);
```

