One kind of resource: its id, its name, the id of its icon, its role, and
the space that one unit takes in a store.

```
use warp_sdk::economy::{ResourceId, ResourceKind, Role};
let ore = ResourceKind::new(ResourceId(1), "ore", "icon.ore", Role::Material).size(2);
assert_eq!(ore.size, 2);
```

