A seed that passed, its best start site and that site's score.

```
use warp_sdk::procgen::{fair_start, FairStart};
let pick = fair_start(0, &FairStart::default(), |_| vec![1.0_f32], |_, s| *s).unwrap();
assert_eq!(pick.seeds_tried, 1);
```

No seed in the range had a fair start.

```
use warp_sdk::procgen::{fair_start, FairStart};
let rule = FairStart { min_score: 2.0, max_seeds: 3 };
let err = fair_start(0, &rule, |_| vec![1.0_f32], |_, s| *s).unwrap_err();
assert_eq!(err.seeds_tried, 3);
```

